适用文件 / Applies to
=====================

本许可证适用于 `uncode_assets/` 中明确标注为移植/对应的文件：

| 本仓库 | wows-toolkit（Rust） |
|---|---|
| `parser.py` | `crates/wowsunpack/src/models/assets_bin.rs` |
| `vfs.py` | `data/assets_bin_vfs.rs` |
| `binary.py` | `parser_utils.rs` |
| `decoders.py` | `models/{material,visual,model}.rs` |

同目录下其余文件（`fx.py` / `atlas_contour.py` / `service.py` / `types.py` /
`parse_rules.py` / `errors.py` / `selftest.py`）为本项目自研，按 Apache-2.0。

This license applies to the files in `uncode_assets/` that are explicitly
marked as ports of / corresponding to wows-toolkit (Rust) modules: `parser.py`
(assets_bin.rs), `vfs.py` (assets_bin_vfs.rs), `binary.py` (parser_utils.rs),
and `decoders.py` (models/{material,visual,model}.rs). The remaining files in
that directory are original work under Apache-2.0.

MIT 与 Apache-2.0 兼容，可与本仓库其余部分一同分发；本目录保留 MIT 归属，
其余部分按 Apache-2.0（见 LICENSE.Apache-2.0）。

MIT is compatible with Apache-2.0 and may be distributed together with the
rest of this repository; this directory retains its MIT attribution while the
remainder is under Apache-2.0 (see LICENSE.Apache-2.0).
